msgid "168 Mhz/256 KB RAM/2 MB Flash"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubepurple-overview.rst:27
#: ba11d887235d481c82bf745dac83ea6e
msgid "32-bit failsafe co-processor"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubepurple-overview.rst:29
#: f0fb387deb7940398999bd5aec07debc
msgid "**Sensors**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubepurple-overview.rst:31
#: 5be4b01f08b94db68e4e8f340bccc7ce
msgid "1 x IMU (accels, gyros and compass)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubepurple-overview.rst:32
#: 34b58d9c109b448d800ceac834801b71
msgid "1 x InvenSense MPU9250 (accel and gyro)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubepurple-overview.rst:33
#: 403d279511264452a5d74e07ee0415fe
msgid "1 x MS5611 barometers"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubepurple-overview.rst:36
#: 088ea704f801480c9935aede137fe03c
msgid "Carrier Board Mini"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubepurple-overview.rst:42
#: 5f1b4bdf22c94facb656de26397b5fe8
msgid "Mini Carrier Board has the standardized DF17 connector which allows the user to connect it to every version of the Cube autopilot. With smaller size and almost the same capability with the standard carrier board, it can better fit in to those applications which have size limits. Also, it can be equipped with the Cube Purple to better fulfil the requests from customers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubepurple-overview.rst:44
#: 11cf280ec1164185bf2b51925c740b63
msgid "Functionality of Carrier Board:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubepurple-overview.rst:46
#: d4940c51cf874de5840a13e20b2e7395
msgid "Dual power input (for redundant power, automatic switch to another power when one fails) Power distribution (limit the current at each connector, avoiding overloading when one device draws too large current) Voltage protection (over or under voltage protection, the circuit will be shut down if the voltage exceeds the limit)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubepurple-overview.rst:54
#: 4e9668ecf4564f208ae09ca1b237ffa2
msgid "The Cube connector pin assignments"
msgstr ""

